  "title": "Peach Cobbler V",
  "description": "With this versatile recipe, you can whip a wonderful peach cobbler up with fresh, frozen or canned peaches. And the same basic recipe works beautifully for other berries and fruit. The only thing you have to remember is that when you spoon the biscuit batter and the peaches into the baking pan, don &#39;t stir.",
